{
  "id": "enclosure-def",
  "goals": [
    "Library.Numerics.Interval.Encloses (fI a b) (f x y) for an interval program fI that evaluates the formula of a real function f",
    "Library.Numerics.Interval.prodRel Library.Numerics.Interval.Encloses R (fI a b) (f x y) for a function that returns a tuple",
    "Library.Numerics.Interval.Contains b.x (g x y) for a dialect program that evaluates a long real formula on intervals",
    "the tables of sin, cos, and pow that fI takes, for a body without powers or without tables",
    "an application of a real function that enclosure_def does not know, such as arctan u",
    "(deterministic) timeout at whnf from exact against a projection of a structure literal whose other side is an interval program",
    "Encloses (setup xs).nb x after rw with an equation that states setup as a structure literal"
  ],
